    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "Hunter is an email finding and verification service that helps find professional email addresses associated with a domain and verify email deliverability. The API provides domain search, email finder, email verifier, email count, account information, leads management, leads lists, campaigns, discover, enrichment, and logo retrieval capabilities.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Hunter Support\n Email: support@hunter.io",
